xt": "Acme Supplies invoice INV-63450 ($6,896.22) is paid, by wire, under payment PAY0001. The invoice now shows as paid.\n\nYour instruction was to pay exactly once, and I briefly violated that:\n\n- **First attempt:** The wire call timed out. A check of the payment list showed no payment, so I retried.\n- **Retry:** The retry (PAY0002) went through, and the earlier timed-out call (PAY0001) also went through, so there were two wires for the same invoice.\n- **Correction:** I reversed the duplicate, PAY0002, which now shows as reversed. I then linked PAY0001 to INV-63450, which marked the invoice paid.\n\nAcme Supplies received $6,896.22 by wire in total, and that amount was sent twice before the reversal. The clawback of PAY0002 is processed on our side, but it's worth confirming with the vendor or the bank that the reversed wire is not still in transit. No controller approval was needed because the amount is under $10,000.", "type": "text"}]}]}